{"t": "Geliştirici API'si", "b": "<h1 id=\"gelistirici-apisi\">Geliştirici API'si<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#gelistirici-apisi\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h1>\n<p>OmniGuard, Bukkit'in <code>ServicesManager</code>'ında tipli bir servis ve Bukkit eventleri sunar. Eksiksiz, derlenen bir örnek\neklenti <a href=\"https://github.com/plisquante/OmniGuard/tree/main/examples/api-example\"><code>examples/api-example</code></a> içindedir.</p>\n<h2 id=\"kurulum\">Kurulum<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#kurulum\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p>OmniGuard jar'ını derleme classpath'inize ekleyin (scope <code>provided</code> / <code>compileOnly</code>) ve bağımlılığı bildirin:</p>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># plugin.yml</span>\n<span class=\"nt\">depend</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">[</span><span class=\"nv\">OmniGuard</span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">]</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># or softdepend</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bukkit</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getServicesManager</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">load</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">class</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// OmniGuard not installed</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>Yalnızca <code>dev.omniguard.api</code> ve <code>dev.omniguard.api.event</code> içindeki sınıfları kullanın. Geri kalan her şey dahilidir ve değişebilir.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#omniguardservice\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Metot</th>\n<th>Açıklama</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>version()</code></td>\n<td>Eklenti sürümü</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isAttackMode()</code> / <code>setAttackMode(\"auto\"\\|\"on\"\\|\"off\")</code></td>\n<td>Saldırı modu</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isMonitorMode()</code></td>\n<td>Yalnızca tespit modu</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isLockdown()</code> / <code>setLockdown(boolean)</code></td>\n<td>Kilitleme</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stats()</code></td>\n<td><code>StatsSnapshot(packets, blocked, kicks, refusedConnections, dupes, packetsPerSecond, blockedPerSecond, trackedItems)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>checks()</code></td>\n<td>Check id → açık/kapalı haritası</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getViolationLevel(uuid, checkId)</code> / <code>getViolations(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Güncel ihlal seviyeleri</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exempt(uuid, checkId, Duration)</code></td>\n<td>Tek bir check'ten geçici muafiyet, ya da hepsi için <code>\"*\"</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>clearExemptions(uuid)</code> / <code>isExempt(uuid, checkId)</code></td>\n<td>Muafiyetleri yönetin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reportViolation(player, source, detail, amount)</code></td>\n<td>Kendi tespitlerinizi OmniGuard'ın uyarılarına, Discord'una, loglarına ve <code>external</code> check'inin cezalarına aktarın</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getLinkedAccounts(name)</code></td>\n<td>IP paylaşmış hesaplar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getItemIdentity(item)</code></td>\n<td>Bir eşyanın ledger kimliği</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>trackItem(item)</code></td>\n<td>Bir eşyaya şimdi kimlik verin (örn. kasa ödülleri); eşyanın sahibi olan thread'de çağırın</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getCustody(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Sahiplik zinciri (<code>CustodyStep(timeMillis, holder)</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isCompromised(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Kimliğin çoğaltıldığı doğrulandı mı</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p><code>trackItem</code> dışındaki tüm metotlar thread-safe'tir. Bilinmeyen check id'leri <code>IllegalArgumentException</code> fırlatır.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ornekler\">Örnekler<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ornekler\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"frlatma-rampanz-srasnda-bir-oyuncuyu-muaf-tutun\">Fırlatma rampanız sırasında bir oyuncuyu muaf tutun<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#frlatma-rampanz-srasnda-bir-oyuncuyu-muaf-tutun\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">exempt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getUniqueId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"invalid-movement\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Duration</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">ofSeconds</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setVelocity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Vector</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"kendi-tespitinizi-bildirin\">Kendi tespitinizi bildirin<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#kendi-tespitinizi-bildirin\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">reportViolation</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"MyAntiCheat\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"reach 6.2 blocks\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"kasa-odullerini-takip-edin\">Kasa ödüllerini takip edin<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#kasa-odullerini-takip-edin\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Material</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">NETHERITE_SWORD</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">UUID</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">trackItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getInventory</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">addItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"eventler\">Eventler<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#eventler\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Event</th>\n<th>İptal edilebilir</th>\n<th>Ne zaman</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardViolationEvent</code></td>\n<td>evet (uyarıyı ve cezayı bastırır)</td>\n<td>Her başarısız check</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardPunishEvent</code></td>\n<td>evet (cezayı kendiniz uygulayın)</td>\n<td>Bir kick veya ceza komutlarından hemen önce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardDupeEvent</code></td>\n<td>evet (el koyma yok, uyarı yok)</td>\n<td>Bir kopya doğrulandığında</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardAttackModeEvent</code></td>\n<td>hayır</td>\n<td>Saldırı modu başladığında veya bittiğinde</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>İhlal ve ceza eventleri <strong>asenkron</strong> olabilir, çünkü paket check'leri Netty thread'lerinde çalışır. Dünyaya dokunmadan önce scheduler'ı kullanın. İptal etmek kötü niyetli paketin geçmesine asla izin vermez.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nd\">@EventHandler</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">onPunish</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardPunishEvent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getCheckId</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">equals</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"packet-rate\"</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setCancelled</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\">                         </span><span class=\"c1\">// no kick from OmniGuard…</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">jail</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getPlayerId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getDetail</span><span class=\"p\">());</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// …your own handling</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"statik-yardmc\">Statik yardımcı<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#statik-yardmc\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>OmniGuardAPI</code> (statik) hızlı okumalar için hâlâ mevcuttur: <code>isAttackMode()</code>, <code>getViolationLevel(...)</code>,\n<code>getBlockedCount(...)</code>, <code>getItemIdentity(...)</code> ve tam <code>OmniGuardService</code> döndüren <code>service()</code>.</p>", "c": "<a href=\"#kurulum\">Kurulum</a><a href=\"#omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService</a><a href=\"#ornekler\">Örnekler</a><a href=\"#eventler\">Eventler</a><a href=\"#statik-yardmc\">Statik yardımcı</a>"}